=============================================================
  FORECAST OF Y GIVEN THE MODELS OF THE 2 INPUT(S)
=============================================================
  Forecasting an output requires forecasting its inputs: the
  transfer needs their future. The forecast error therefore adds
  the series' own innovation and EVERY innovation upstream of it
  in the network, each propagated through the nu(B) it crosses.

